---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy & Fulfillment Policies | SomaShiva™ Sacred Store" description="Transparent, sacred handling of your personal details, prepaid orders, and insured transit.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-[#4A3B2C]">
    <!-- Breadcrumb / Back Link -->
    <div class="mb-8">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-[#7A5212] hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path></svg>
        ← Back to Sacred Catalog
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <div class="text-center space-y-4 mb-12">
      <span class="inline-block bg-white border border-[#E6CA65] text-[#996515] px-5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-widest shadow-sm uppercase">
        SANCTUM TRUST & POLICIES
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#7A5212]">
        Privacy & Fulfillment Policies
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#8B5E14] font-light max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Transparent, sacred handling of your personal details, prepaid orders, and insured transit.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Four Ivory Cards Grid -->
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <!-- Card 1: Customer Data & Privacy Policy -->
      <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#e5d5b5] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-[#996515] font-bold">1</div>
          <h2 class="font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-2xl font-bold text-[#7A5212]">Customer Data & Privacy Policy</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A3B2C] font-light leading-relaxed">
          We collect your Name, Delivery Address, Pincode, Email, and WhatsApp Number strictly to fulfill your order, generate courier manifests, and contact you regarding your shipment. We never sell, rent, or share customer data with third-party advertisers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: 100% Prepaid Order Policy -->
      <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#e5d5b5] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-[#996515] font-bold">2</div>
          <h2 class="font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-2xl font-bold text-[#7A5212]">100% Prepaid Order Policy</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A3B2C] font-light leading-relaxed">
          All orders on SomaShiva™ are strictly 100% Prepaid (via UPI or Bank Transfer). Cash on Delivery (COD) is not offered. Once your order is placed, payment is verified via WhatsApp prior to package consecration and dispatch.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Airway Bill (AWB) & WhatsApp Tracking -->
      <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#e5d5b5] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-[#996515] font-bold">3</div>
          <h2 class="font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-2xl font-bold text-[#7A5212]">Airway Bill (AWB) & WhatsApp Tracking</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A3B2C] font-light leading-relaxed">
          As soon as your crystals or sound healing instruments are packed and dispatched, your official Airway Bill (AWB) number and live courier tracking link are shared directly on your WhatsApp along with transit updates.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Defects & Uncut Unboxing Video Replacement Policy -->
      <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#e5d5b5] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-[#996515] font-bold">4</div>
          <h2 class="font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-2xl font-bold text-[#7A5212]">Defects & Uncut Unboxing Video Replacement Policy</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4A3B2C] font-light leading-relaxed">
          Returns for change of mind are not accepted. We provide 100% replacement exclusively for manufacturing defects or shipping/transit damage. To establish where the issue occurred, we strongly recommend recording a single continuous, uncut unboxing video showing the shipping label and intact package seal before opening. Submit any defect claims with the video via our WhatsApp customer care portal (<a href="https://wa.me/919180603108" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#996515] font-semibold underline">+91 9180603108</a>) within 48 hours of delivery.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom CTAs -->
    <div class="pt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="/" class="btn-gradient-all w-full sm:w-auto bg-[#996515] hover:bg-[#7A5212] text-white font-semibold py-4 px-8 rounded-2xl text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition text-center shadow-md">
        Explore Sacred Catalog
      </a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/919180603108?text=Namaste%20SomaShiva,%20I%20have%20an%20inquiry%20regarding%20sanctum%20policies." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 border border-[#E6CA65] text-[#7A5212] font-semibold py-4 px-8 rounded-2xl text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition text-center shadow-sm">
        Contact WhatsApp Support
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
